    <panel_attributes>Thymeleaf views (boundary): vault.html, posting.html,
tailor.html, tracker.html, dashboard.html.
tailor.html listens to /tailor/{id}/events (SSE)
for live agent steps and questions.
CoopPilotFacade also holds: AgentController, VaultService,
ResumeLibrary, FitScorer, KeywordScanner, RevisionHistory,
CondenseStrategy, ExportService and the LlmTasks.
